IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE1.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-X PIC X(10) VALUE "AB".
01 WS-Z PIC Z(5)9.
01 WS-E PIC 9V9(30).
01 WS-PI PIC 9V9(30).
01 WS-R PIC 9(12).
01 WS-S PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE -12.34.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    DISPLAY "X:[" WS-X "]"
    DISPLAY "X:" WS-X
    MOVE 0 TO WS-Z
    DISPLAY "Z:" WS-Z
    COMPUTE WS-E = FUNCTION E
    DISPLAY "E :" WS-E
    COMPUTE WS-PI = FUNCTION PI
    DISPLAY "PI:" WS-PI
    COMPUTE WS-R = 2 ** 3 ** 4
    DISPLAY "2**3**4=" WS-R
    DISPLAY "S:" WS-S
    STOP RUN.
